{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#card-zh","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型与推理强度选择器：它接管输入框的模型席位，提供模型浏览面板和推理强度滑条。用户可按提供方浏览并搜索模型，切换后调整模型声明的推理档位，也可恢复默认档位；滑条支持鼠标或触屏拖动及键盘操作。界面有中英文字典、深色主题适配和按会话保存的 Fast 视觉开关，Fast 不会改变真实速度或用量。适合希望在写消息时集中管理模型与推理档位的 DSH Web 用户；需要兼容 DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 至 0.2.x，不需要额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1649-1690","client.js:669-781","client.js:620-652"]}
{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#card-en","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector adds a model browser and reasoning slider to DSH Web. Browse providers, search and switch models, adjust declared effort levels, or reset to default. It supports pointer and keyboard input, Chinese and English, and dark mode. Fast is a visual-only per-session toggle.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1649-1690","client.js:669-781","client.js:620-652"]}
