{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#feature-effort-slider","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector 的功能「推理强度滑条」：显示当前模型声明的档位，拖动时连续预览并在释放时吸附到最近档，也可用方向键、Home 和 End 调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1128-1180","client.js:1506-1520"]}
{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#feature-reset","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector 的功能「恢复默认档位」：点击重置按钮恢复当前模型的默认推理强度；没有声明默认值时选择中间档，并关闭 Fast 标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1481-1485","client.js:900-950"]}
{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#feature-provider-list","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector 的功能「提供方浏览」：打开模型面板后先显示提供方列表，选择提供方进入其模型列表；当前模型所属提供方会带有标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1330-1425"]}
{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#feature-model-search","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector 的功能「模型搜索」：进入提供方的模型列表后可输入查询，按不区分大小写的顺序字符匹配筛选模型，并可清除搜索。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1437-1448","client.js:1240-1274"]}
{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#feature-switch-model","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector 的功能「切换模型」：选择列表中的模型后调用 DSH 会话模型目录的选择接口，成功后回到推理强度面板；没有档位的模型不附带推理强度字段。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:900-950","client.js:1380-1406"]}
