{"unit_id":"ABING1111__dsh-codex-model-effort-selector#caveat-fast-is-visual","repo":"ABING1111/dsh-codex-model-effort-selector","commit":"816b636fa3b6af95d3c229e7cb3d24040cf7fec0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-model-effort-selector 使用前须知：Fast 开关只是视觉标记，不会改变真实速度或用量；偏好按会话写入浏览器 localStorage。（见 client.js:620-652）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:620-652"]}